  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He had read the man's whole history off the back of his hand.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 3.92
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "A blue anchor tattooed on the hand, he said. A military carriage. There was the marine.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 5.708,
      "seconds": 6.64
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Then he threw me a note, and said he had been wrong about crime.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 13.875,
      "seconds": 4.19
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "A bad business in the night, he said, and we might as well go and look.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 19.583,
      "seconds": 4.24
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "We drove out through a dun-coloured fog, and he talked to me about violins.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 25.542,
      "seconds": 5.56
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "sherlock_holmes",
      "text": "No data yet. It is a mistake to theorise before you have the evidence.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 32.625,
      "seconds": 4.28
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "A man lay dead across the city, and my friend discussed Cremona fiddles.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 38.417,
      "seconds": 5.32
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Number three wore an ill-omened look, and two of the four houses stood empty.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 45.458,
      "seconds": 5.6
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "I expected him to rush inside. He walked the pavement and stared at the mud.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 52.792,
      "seconds": 5.1
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "The clay was printed over with a dozen boots, and rain had been at it all night.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 59.417,
      "seconds": 5.02
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Twice he stopped. Once he smiled. I could not see what there was to smile at.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 65.958,
      "seconds": 5.3
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "A tall white-faced man met us and said nothing had been touched.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 72.958,
      "seconds": 4.42
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Except that, he said, pointing back at the trampled path behind us.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 78.708,
      "seconds": 4.86
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "The room was bare, and the dead man lay in the middle of the floor.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 84.875,
      "seconds": 3.77
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "Well dressed, and a card in his pocket: Enoch Drebber, of Cleveland, Ohio.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 90.167,
      "seconds": 5.63
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "There was blood in that room. There was no wound anywhere upon him.",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 97.333,
      "seconds": 4.2
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "So I knelt where he had knelt, and tried to read the floor myself.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 103.042,
      "seconds": 5.2
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "I saw dust, and the marks of a dozen boots. Nothing else.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 109.958,
      "seconds": 4.66
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "g_lestrade",
      "text": "I have made a discovery of the highest importance. Come here. Stand there.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 116.333,
      "seconds": 4.7
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "One word, scrawled across the bare plaster in letters of blood-red.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 122.542,
      "seconds": 5.05
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "g_lestrade",
      "text": "Rachel. He was writing a woman's name, and was disturbed before he finished.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 129.625,
      "seconds": 4.88
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "For twenty minutes he crawled, measuring distances between things I could not see.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 136.208,
      "seconds": 5.27
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "sherlock_holmes",
      "text": "Six feet high, in his prime, small feet, square-toed boots, a Trichinopoly cigar.",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 143.0,
      "seconds": 5.86
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "john_watson",
      "text": "He had watched a man I never saw.",
      "shot": 23,
      "at": 150.167,
      "seconds": 2.7
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "sherlock_holmes",
      "text": "Rache is the German for revenge. Waste no time on Miss Rachel.",
      "shot": 24,
      "at": 154.583,
      "seconds": 4.16
    }
  ]
}